WEB SOURCE (the specification — read end to end)
  web/src/components/ai/AIAlertTuningSuggestions.tsx — the Helix alert-tuning card. It is
  `withAiFeature('alert-tuning-suggestions', InnerSection)` (a `useAiEnabled` gate; disabled ⇒ the HOC
  renders `null`). InnerSection uses `useTranslation` + `useAiStream({ url:
  '/ai/alerts/rules/${ruleId}/tune/draft', body, onEvent: handleEvent })` where
  `body = vehicleId == null ? {} : { vehicle_id: vehicleId }`. It captures `tool_result` frames whose
  `name === 'draft_alert_rule_patch'`, `ok === true`, `data.status === 'ok'`, and `data.proposed` is an
  object into a typed `AlertRuleDraftPatch` (value_num / value_min / value_max / cooldown_min taken only
  when numeric; severity / trigger_mode / op only when a non-empty string). It renders the shared
  `AIFeatureCard` with title `t('notifications.alertStudio.aiTuning.title','Suggest lower-noise
  tuning')`, description `…propose a typed AlertRule patch. Descriptive replay only — review before
  saving.`, button `t('…suggestButton','Suggest tuning')`, badge `t('…badge','Helix')`,
  `canStart = !!ruleId && stream.state !== 'paused-confirm'`, `buttonPlacement='below'`,
  `onAction=handleSuggest` (resets proposal then `stream.start()`), feeding `AiOutputPanel`. When a
  proposal is captured it renders an "Apply to form" button (`disabled={proposal == null || isBusy}`,
  `isBusy = streaming || paused-confirm`; click → `onApplyDraft(proposal)`) over a preview panel
  `t('…previewLabel','Proposed patch (review before saving):')` listing the present proposed scalars.
  The AI panel NEVER persists (ADR-015 §I3+§I8): onApplyDraft hands the patch to the AlertStudio editor
  whose Save button is the sole write path. cancel() runs on unmount AND on ruleId change.

  Composed shared primitives reproduced for parity (their native atoms are owned by the P4 component-
  library bundle — out of scope here and not yet present — so they are reproduced as private subviews
  scoped to this surface, the only files this prompt may touch):
    • AIFeatureCard  : GlassPanel → (title h3 + AIBadge) → description → universal "Ask Helix" button
                       (idle "Ask Helix" / streaming "Helix is thinking…"; disabled = !canStart ||
                       isStreaming; aria-label "Ask Helix · {buttonLabel}") → children → AiOutputPanel.
    • AiOutputPanel  : nothing while idle+no text; AIThinkingIndicator (shimmer lines + dots) while
                       streaming before the first delta; the streamed prose once text arrives;
                       "Helix error: {message}".
    • useAiStream    : idle → streaming → (done | error | paused-confirm); `delta.text` accumulates; a
                       non-OK HTTP response finalises as "stream_http_{status}"; unknown SSE event types
                       are dropped; `tool_result` frames captured by the component (not the hook).

